# 1. CORE BUSINESS PROBLEM

Small and medium businesses often have enough sales demand to increase inventory, but their existing shop/premises do not have enough storage space.

They usually have to:

- rent an entire warehouse,
- pay large deposits,
- commit to long contracts,
- waste money on unused capacity,
- or stop increasing inventory.

At the same time, many property owners and businesses have unused storage space.

StoreFlex connects these two sides.

Example:

A businessman needs:

200 sq ft

for:

3 months

instead of renting a 5,000 sq ft warehouse.

StoreFlex allows him to discover, compare, book and pay for only the storage capacity he needs.

