# 2. IMPORTANT BUSINESS MODEL

Use a MARKETPLACE MODEL.

Do NOT make StoreFlex buy/rent large warehouses itself in the MVP.

Instead:

SPACE OWNER
↓
Lists available storage
↓
StoreFlex verifies it
↓
BUSINESSMAN discovers it
↓
Businessman books storage
↓
Businessman pays StoreFlex
↓
StoreFlex takes commission
↓
Remaining amount is payable to space owner

Example:

Customer pays:
₹20/sq ft/month

Owner receives:
₹16/sq ft/month

StoreFlex commission:
₹4/sq ft/month

The commission percentage must be configurable from the admin dashboard.

